        "text": "First class service. I had my eyes checked here in the last couple of weeks. Bought my frames here also. The staff were absolutely brilliant. Very very friendly. Very professional. And most accommodating when I arrived in with my 4 month old!! Very reasonably priced too for everything. I would highly recommend them to anyone. Thanks very much for all your help.\n\nNeil",
