        "text": "10/10 for the eyes exam very professional and great optometriste.The customer service 10/10 people are so nice. 2/10 There was a guy there he dont even hi,or good morning to you he had a very bad attitude and was not able to open my file online not able to help me with nothing  in the shop.\nI was so dispointed and even the second time i went there  he made me wait 30 mins after that a lady came to help me. I will never go there again .Honestly if the guy dont correct his attitude a lot  of customer will go away. I got my glass 5 weeks after insted of 3 weeks. Thanks to the lady eho served me properly.\nSecuro vision glasses  10/10 . Find a place with less headach",
